          ],
          "text": "According to SETH KRETZER, Texas\u2019s policy historically allowed a spiritual advisor to be present and lay hands on a condemned inmate."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "State",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "373ffcc233747286c8c020c74339d6a7c5718e5547d844a4e4e02f8924231da8",
              "evidence_ids": [
