              "pages": {
                "end": 6,
                "start": 6
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to SETH KRETZER, Texas argued that its restrictions on touch and prayer were not the least restrictive means of furthering its execution interest."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Texas",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "b41787594986dab5f455267fa334f36b29b34b654ed3e781019755cfecb6548f",
