              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 20,
                "start": 20
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Texas, the State argued that a categorical ban on audible prayer was necessary to monitor the inmate\u2019s condition and avoid distraction."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Respondents",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "b41787594986dab5f455267fa334f36b29b34b654ed3e781019755cfecb6548f",
