              "pages": {
                "end": 22,
                "start": 22
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Respondents, the State argued that allowing a spiritual advisor to touch the inmate could place the advisor in harm\u2019s way and enable tampering with restraints or IV lines."
        },
